  (text "EPB: 2 H-bridges (2x BTN8982TA each), left + right caliper.  Pawl: 1 BTN8982TA used as a\nhigh-side switch (single direction; actuator - grounds at the motor).  IN=1 drives OUT to VS.\nBTN8982 VS abs max 40 V -> SMCJ22A on each motor feed (Vc ~35.5 V).  No reverse protection on the\nmotor feeds: reverse battery conducts through the body diodes -> the EXTERNAL fuse must blow.\nEach half-bridge IS has its own 1k sense resistor and ADC1 pin (per-side, per-direction current).\nINA226 measures total EPB supply current on a 2 mOhm Kelvin shunt (sheet Sensors).\nBulk: 2x 470uF 35V on EPB_VS, 220uF 35V on PAWL_12V.  Caliper / pawl stall current: TBD (measure)."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "04dff038-0553-5f8d-9712-8fc44389fce7")))
